\end_layout

\begin_layout Proof
נשים לב לכך שמתקיים:
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
\bigcup_{n=1}^{\infty}A_{n}=\bigcup_{n=2}^{\infty}\left(\bigcup_{k=1}^{k=n}\left\{ \left(k,n-k\right)\right\} \right)=\bigcup_{n=2}^{\infty}\left(\bigcup_{k+j=n}\left\{ \left(k,j\right)\right\} \right)
\]

\end_inset

והרי לכל 
\begin_inset Formula $n\in\MKnatural$
\end_inset

